; Communications Department, including the Print Shop, by providing reliable pickup and delivery of materials among TidalHealth hospitals, medical offices, administrative locations and other facilities throughout the Delmarva Peninsula.</span></p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">High School diploma or equivalent required.</span></li></ul><p class=\"xxxmsolistparagraph\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License and/or certification:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Valid Driver’s license is required and insurability under TidalHealth’s automobile insurance plan.</span></li></ul><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Previous courier, delivery, transportation or customer service experience preferred.</span></li><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Familiarity with the Delmarva Peninsula and TidalHealth service area preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xxxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift.</span></li><li class=\"xxxmsonormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Hours based on departmental needs.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thanks,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder, SHRM-CP</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Human Resources Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>tidalhealth.org</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Have a question for HR?&nbsp; Send it to our Shared Services team.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8/a/7f4b8c55-c804-4afa-93c3-f7308ddcbdae?tenantId=ff279a42-1cb6-4542-b65a-95186f081fd8&amp;hint=384e5157-8ea1-4b5c-912b-4a3979a7f5f3&amp;source=sharebutton&amp;sourcetime=1769439969989\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">HR Questions &amp; Answers</span></a><i></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}